cub_top — CUBRID memory observer
================================

This project is licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE), the same
license as the CUBRID engine and this repository.

Dependencies / 의존성:

  src/cub_top.c is a single-file C99 program that includes only standard C
  and POSIX/Linux headers. It does NOT include or link any CUBRID header or
  library, and it does not link libelf or libdw — <elf.h> is used for its
  type declarations only, and the ELF and DWARF parsing is original code.

  본 소스는 CUBRID 헤더를 포함하지 않으며 libc 외 의존이 없습니다.
  따라서 CUBRID(Apache-2.0) 코드의 복제·파생이 포함되어 있지 않습니다.

Derived data / 파생 데이터:

  The offset tables under offsets/*.tbl are numeric field offsets and struct
  sizes extracted from the DWARF debug information of CUBRID builds by
  tools/dwoff.c. They contain no CUBRID source code — only symbol names and
  integers describing the on-memory layout of that build.

  offsets/*.tbl 은 CUBRID 빌드의 DWARF 에서 추출한 심볼 이름과 오프셋·크기
  수치입니다. CUBRID 소스 코드를 포함하지 않습니다.

